  <name>n3o-slic3r</name>
  <summary>Multi-printer-first desktop slicer</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      n3o-slic3r is a desktop slicer that drives OrcaSlicer's libslic3r
      engine, built for running several different printers from one
      project. It targets a transparent settings cascade, a slice-and-send
      workflow, and a Lua plugin system for G-code post-processing — with
      no other slicer required at runtime.
    </p>
  </description>
